  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Co-op Bank Utilities and NRW Loan Program supports Kenyan water utilities to reduce non-revenue water and improve service delivery through a blended finance model combining commercial loans, performance-based grants, and technical assistance. The programme aims to mobilise commercial investment for utility efficiency improvements, expand water access, strengthen utility finances, and contribute to climate resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
